(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-26","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["叶澄说她的验收[[questionable|有问题]]，却先抱怨值班员燃的[[incense|香]]呛。她怕承认的[[implication|牵连]]太大，拖到[[twilight|黄昏]]才坐下。那种[[melancholy|忧郁]]不是答案。我没叫她[[rascal|无赖]]，只把旁管照片摊开，问她的[[ingenuity|精巧设计]]怎么变成眼前的口。桌上[[camel|骆驼]]杯垫浸了茶，窗外晾的[[underwear|内衣]]来回晃，普通生活几乎让这场谈话显得多余。叶澄是研究[[molecular|分子的]]材料的工程师，她一眼便认出铆牌，说那不是她批准安装的版本，可验收页的笔迹确实属于她。","她说自己按[[regular|定期的]]要求送检查报告，原程序[[kernel|核心]]从来没允许旧泵混用。我不小心[[bump|撞]]倒茶杯，她把[[unpleasant|令人不快的]]纸摊开，说贺青不像[[monarch|帝王]]那样下命令，只讲不能让援助中断。报告的[[regularity|规律性]]显示她连做四次检查，却漏第五次。她不愿听自己的[[lamentation|悲叹]]，让我们看[[per|每]]日泵时。一个[[vase|花瓶]]遮住了运行[[movement|变化]]的末段，那里恰好是滤筒拆走后仍长时间开泵的日子。她先移开花瓶，接着又把那页往自己面前拉。","程雾说要[[regularly|按规则地]]保存原件，叶澄却有些[[mad|生气]]，不让我们[[proceed|继续]]翻。我从她的[[view|视角]]知道工资和家人都押在基金上，不能因此接受假账。晚饭盒里有[[mustard|芥末]]，旧施工[[remains|残余物]]装在袋里，两个世界挤着一张桌。老陈没扮[[merciful|仁慈的]]裁判，只说[[considering|考虑到]]她知道得多，我们会等她把真实情况讲完。他用一枚[[walnut|胡桃]]压住翘纸角。叶澄[[nervous|紧张]]地停了手，终于让程雾拍运行表，但签字页仍盖在另一只手下。","她的[[representation|陈述]]是有条件通过，螺[[nut|帽]]与滤筒待补。工程[[corporation|公司]]后来把临时泵宣传为[[waterfall|瀑布]]水源。居民需要[[nourishment|营养]]和水，她以为争取资金比争取一句限制更有用。我问这是否等于[[robbery|夺走]]他们选择，她说一个人替[[oneself|自己]]辩解最容易，却不能[[dismiss|排除]]后果。一位[[weaver|织工]]到窗口问水检，身形[[obese|肥胖]]的值班员拿出旧[[rule|规则]]挡他。叶澄站起来，请那人留下联系方式；这是她今天第一次把桌边的责任带到窗口以外。","织工替一个[[orphan|孤儿]]家庭领水，叶澄[[propose|提议]]另查他们那条支线。值班员要用[[whisky|威士忌]]请老陈打发时间，老陈不喝。我的[[obsession|执念]]是拿到她全部签字，可若变得[[ruthless|无情]]，那户人的水也不会因此好起来。叶澄把[[outermost|最外侧的]]图层抽出，说要先[[reform|改正]]旁路。窗外[[willow|柳树]]下有一股怪[[odour|气味]]，她记起工人曾在上游闻过同样气味。记录她仍留了一部分，我看见她的自保，也看见她已经无法再把旁管称为别人没告诉她的事。","她答应次日带我们核对上游阀门，却把签字原页锁进抽屉。何警官在电话里让她保存好，不许再改。我们带走批准提供的运行表影像，并约织工来标居民支线。程雾走到门外才说叶澄避开的不是一个人名，而是那一晚她到底看见多少。我点头，写下她确认的时间：拆滤筒之后，系统仍连续运行。明天我们先关住实际把旧沟水送进居民线的口，再追她不肯交出的那页；救人的顺序不能被我的急躁倒过来。"],"en":["Ye called her acceptance [[questionable|questionable]] but complained first about [[incense|incense]]. Fearing [[implication|implication]], she waited until [[twilight|twilight]]. [[melancholy|Melancholy]] answered nothing. Instead of naming a [[rascal|rascal]], I asked how design [[ingenuity|ingenuity]] became our photographed opening. A [[camel|camel]] coaster soaked in tea; [[underwear|underwear]] moved outside. This [[molecular|molecular]] materials engineer recognized an unauthorized plate version. The acceptance handwriting nevertheless was hers.","Her [[regular|regular]] reports never allowed old pumps; that was the procedure's [[kernel|kernel]]. I would [[bump|bump]] a cup, and she spread [[unpleasant|unpleasant]] papers. He Qing commanded no [[monarch|monarch]]'s obedience, only uninterrupted aid. Their [[regularity|regularity]] showed four checks, then a missing fifth. Rejecting [[lamentation|lamentation]], she showed run hours [[per|per]] day. A [[vase|vase]] hid the last [[movement|movement]]: prolonged running after filter removal. She moved it, then pulled the sheet toward herself.","Cheng requested that originals be kept [[regularly|regularly]]. Ye grew [[mad|mad]], refusing to [[proceed|proceed]]. From her [[view|view]], wages and family depended on the fund. A supper box with [[mustard|mustard]] shared space with construction [[remains|remains]]. Chen offered no [[merciful|merciful]] judgment. [[considering|Considering]] her knowledge, he would wait for the truth, weighting a corner with a [[walnut|walnut]]. [[nervous|Nervous]], she permitted photographs of hours but covered the signature sheet.","Her [[representation|representation]] described conditional passage, pending a [[nut|nut]] and filter. The [[corporation|corporation]] publicized a [[waterfall|waterfall]] source. Residents needed [[nourishment|nourishment]] and water; she prioritized funds over restrictions. Was that [[robbery|robbery]] of their choice? Defending [[oneself|oneself]] was easy, she said, but consequences could not be [[dismiss|dismissed]]. An [[obese|obese]] clerk cited a [[rule|rule]] to turn away a [[weaver|weaver]] asking about tests. Ye rose and requested his contact: responsibility finally traveled beyond her desk.","The weaver collected water for an [[orphan|orphan]] household. Ye would [[propose|propose]] a branch check. Chen declined offered [[whisky|whisky]]. My [[obsession|obsession]] with her signature could become [[ruthless|ruthless]] without improving their water. Drawing out the [[outermost|outermost]] layer, Ye would first [[reform|reform]] the bypass. An [[odour|odour]] beneath [[willow|willow]] trees recalled workers' upstream reports. She retained records, still protecting herself, but could no longer claim complete ignorance of the side pipe.","Ye agreed to check upstream valves tomorrow, locking away her original signature. He instructed her to preserve it unchanged. We took authorized run-sheet images and arranged to map the weaver's branch. Outside, Cheng said Ye avoided what she saw that night, rather than merely a name. I recorded her confirmed fact: running continued after filter removal. Tomorrow we should isolate the actual route into residential supply before pursuing her withheld page. My impatience could not reverse the order of helping people."]});
